# Server-only: never prefix database credentials or device tokens with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Browser-facing API URL for REST and WebSocket (public, not a secret).
# Defaults to port 8000 on the host serving the page, which also works from a phone on the LAN.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Optional sign-in (Supabase Auth, email and password). Both are public by design: the project URL and the
# publishable key (sb_publishable_...). Never put a service-role key or secret key here.
# Leave either unset and sign-in, „Моите обекти“ and device onboarding stay hidden; the app works as before.
# Put the real values in apps/web/.env.local (git-ignored) and restart npm run dev.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
